{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/OutputAt"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timeout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"Duration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"customError","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Error","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP"},{"text":")?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Timeout","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SuspendingClock","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency15SuspendingClockV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"title":"timeout(_:customError:)","modules":[{"relatedModules":["_Concurrency"],"name":"Afluent"}],"extendedModule":"_Concurrency","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Available when"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"type":"text","text":" conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"conformancePrefix":[{"type":"text","text":"Conforms when"}]},"roleHeading":"Instance Method","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE7timeout_11customErrorAA14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutVy_x12_Concurrency15SuspendingClockVGs8DurationV_s0F0_pSgtF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO8OutputAtV","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/TimeoutSequence.swift#L176","fileName":"TimeoutSequence.swift"}},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/OutputAt\/timeout(_:customError:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Fails if the sequence goes the given duration without producing an element, measured on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a ","type":"text"},{"code":"SuspendingClock","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/outputat\/timeout(_:customerror:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"timeout"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"duration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Duration","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8DurationV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"customError"},{"kind":"text","text":": (any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Error","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP"},{"kind":"text","text":")? = nil) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","text":"AsyncSequences","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Timeout","text":"Timeout","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO7TimeoutV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SuspendingClock","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency15SuspendingClockV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"duration","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The longest the sequence may go without an element.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"customError","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The error to throw when the timer fires. Defaults to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimeoutError.timedOut(duration:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of the same elements that throws if the upstream goes quiet."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The timer starts when iteration begins and restarts with every element, so it bounds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"wait for the first element and each gap after it, never the sequence as a whole. Elements"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass through unchanged. When the timer fires, the upstream is cancelled and the sequence"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The upstream is read ahead of the consumer, and elements it produces while the consumer is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"busy are buffered, so the timer measures the upstream’s gaps. A duration of zero or less","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"throws before the first element.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Example"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["for try await event in serverEvents.timeout(.seconds(30)) {","    handle(event)","}","\/\/ Throws TimeoutError.timedOut if 30 seconds pass without an event"]},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"TimeoutError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (or ","type":"text"},{"code":"customError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") when ","type":"text"},{"code":"duration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" passes between elements, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"any error the upstream throws.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Throws"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On WASI, a sleep on a real clock ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContinuousClock"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SuspendingClock"},{"type":"text","text":") holds the one thread"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"until its deadline, even when other work is ready, and cancelling it doesn’t end it sooner. So the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timer can hold the thread before the upstream runs, then count that wait against it and throw even"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"though elements were ready. A test clock is unaffected."}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Note"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences/OutputAt":{"kind":"symbol","title":"AsyncSequences.OutputAt","abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/OutputAt","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OutputAt"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/outputat","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OutputAt"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","role":"collection","title":"Afluent","url":"\/documentation\/afluent","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences/Timeout":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Timeout","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Timeout","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Used as the implementation detail for the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/_Concurrency\/AsyncSequence\/timeout(_:clock:tolerance:customError:)"},{"type":"text","text":" operator."}],"type":"topic","title":"AsyncSequences.Timeout","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/timeout","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Timeout","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences","title":"AsyncSequences","abstract":[{"text":"A namespace for grouping related AsyncSequence operations.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncSequences/OutputAt/timeout(_:customError:)":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/outputat\/timeo